{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_title", "source_sha256": "5af0c1f0ae4581258c50f523f5b1e8b0475d54766202466bfa2120cbd8e0a45c", "ja": "特別ではない日", "zh": "非特别的日子", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_synopsis", "source_sha256": "164daf11361d2c49f613e76bef55e0b828bba0fb42a38438cfa910fd702cd8a8", "ja": "ある賞の受賞に伴い、定期公演に特別な\nお客さんが来ることに。星梨花は「いつもと\n同じ公演でいいのか」と疑問を持つが、アイ\nドル達は普段から頑張っていると気づき、\n『いつもどおり』のかけがえのなさを知る。", "zh": "因为荣获了某个奖项，定期公演将迎来特别的\n客人。虽然星梨花心生疑问：“照平常那样演\n出就可以了吗？”，但意识到偶像们平时就一直在\n努力后，明白了“一如既往”也是无可替代的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1000_p", "source_sha256": "999f9a4ccbfaae9ffc5bf9f6e1cbc1f6888eb1f073d88db33f60679bf029c7be", "ja": "（定期公演が終わった。選考委員の人達はもちろん、\n星梨花のお父さんも満足した様子で、良かった）", "zh": "（定期公演结束了。评选委员们自不必说，就连星梨花的父亲看起来也很满意，真是太好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1001_p", "source_sha256": "45e80fd4c795ca13bf9e8149657c072387b4d450764e6930fae4fb61292f5660", "ja": "（それにしても、肝心の星梨花の姿が見えないな。\nどこに行ったんだろう？）", "zh": "（话说回来，关键的星梨花却不见人影啊。\n去哪里了呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "4bc9992121b6db4292a92f52d7faea37746bcacf966d8e89bbc72829e7111e47", "ja": "……ふぅ。", "zh": "……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1003_p", "source_sha256": "380bb250d6b66ba779524b06c79cea98063dc981c946a2a33ed82fc15fae11c4", "ja": "星梨花、こんなところにいたんだな。\n着替えないのか？", "zh": "原来星梨花在这里啊。\n不换衣服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "6b6540fb5dcb767ddfdae44f9efd0d3ed63c5ce7f6793af1d1ac81a7095c9052", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6963d5be46d00ffedd799d319857f7fc4996d1b53e34c9ea6e541a753a52a370", "ja": "公演が終わったばかりなのに、浮かない顔だな。\n何か、気になる事でもあったのか？", "zh": "演出刚结束，你怎么一副闷闷不乐的样子。\n是有什么在意的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "582c253f1b24037d42e8422537e32f34fe4a32835dfae3f016dba17dfea35e0d", "ja": "……あの、{$P$}さん。\nわたし、ひとつ気になったことがあって……。", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}先生。\n我有一件在意的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "0d6f05098c97cd0bc49e2aef23c11671cb44d1c2d83a3eb84d21dd5e0f6b6809", "ja": "今回、わたしたちが賞をいただけたのは……\nわたしのパパや、そのお友達のおかげなんでしょうか？", "zh": "这次我们能获奖……是因为我的爸爸，还有他的朋友们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1008_p", "source_sha256": "75e827bfad5a3b951be3d8fe1f64557d0946d7190b7550020c3dac2e2e1b9bb8", "ja": "きっかけは、そうかもしれないな。", "zh": "或许，契机确实是这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "15ba1fbcd28244571f2e7bf59a367a0e0e260065960eb179b66d55798d2d8f18", "ja": "わたし、この前、パパのお友達に言われたんです。\nしっかりしたって。でも……。", "zh": "我前阵子被爸爸的朋友夸奖了。\n说我变得懂事了。可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "a02af71bdae0dc0ee96d92ec85f8e0fb3ea9a368898d5b848ce6d57dcb7ebc0a", "ja": "今回、わたしが褒めてもらえたのも、\nパパのおかげだったんだな、って……。", "zh": "这次能得到夸奖，也是多亏了爸爸……我这么想着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e1eb89b1e2c4f1fb1870cca2c2da29915935902246ff9974f95c094f27ac0aa5", "ja": "そうだな。でもこの前言ったとおり、それは、\n星梨花やみんなが積み重ねたものがあるからこそ、だ。", "zh": "是啊。不过就像之前说过的，正因为有星梨花和大家一点一滴积累下来的努力，才会这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "22d89d1d55aa844f93f5a394416be38f0fb3a8bf80d69c7b1d8dadbab6b8db34", "ja": "わたしたちが、努力しているから。ですか？", "zh": "是因为我们在努力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2f20e9668010eeb82002ad5b39793f0dc58a6ba4c0233ff60dc05c9977d0cb7b", "ja": "ああ。努力は自分で選ぶ事ができるけど、\n機会やタイミングを掴むのは、難しいんだ。", "zh": "是啊。努力是可以由自己选择的，\n但要抓住机会和时机，就很难了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c7899460ddc8b62b979eb265a3cffbf8218496a001efa0af33eb17c5c27d3baf", "ja": "でも765プロのアイドル達なら、いつそれが来ても\n大丈夫だって信じてる。もちろん、星梨花もだよ。", "zh": "不过，我相信即使那一刻随时到来，765专业偶像们也都能应对自如。当然，星梨花也一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "4b74acc149ea44c9f9507f5fb97e2b0d492229ca8b755362db91390e9f758454", "ja": "わたしも……。", "zh": "我也是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "199137fea9f53356ccd4a4ff5fd36e6dd8c3457d008670a77631aa6bddde6d4f", "ja": "{$P$}さん。わたしはいつか、\nパパの力がなくても、すごいアイドルになれますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。我以后就算\n没有爸爸的力量，也能成为非常厉害的偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a7f82cbc6e943da403ff88bf24e498a8fa64872c4515a686ab947e3fe4e11cf9", "ja": "勿論だ。星梨花はきっと、すごいアイドルになる。\nその時は、お父さんやお友達をびっくりさせてやろう！", "zh": "当然。星梨花一定会成为很厉害的偶像。\n到那时，就让爸爸和朋友们大吃一惊吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "6d5600b4b6698d8e847e001de9caed9293f45b120de798150da6c8d491561431", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nはいっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a378f8d07788b391456771e387109af32718b5c9abc8fd076da46a0acc107cc5", "ja": "（今の星梨花に言う言葉として、これが\n正解かどうかはわからない。けど……）", "zh": "（我不知道把这句话对现在的星梨花说出来，究竟是不是正确的选择。不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1021_p", "source_sha256": "34386cc0977d85f41036572215d88078aa2f3434564d93ec008978f8ed5ad566", "ja": "（人一倍真面目で努力家な星梨花なら、きっと。\n他人の力を借りなくても、本物になれるはずだ）", "zh": "（星梨花这么认真又努力，一定能不借助他人的力量，也成为真正的偶像。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_115_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "50591386a33662c82a239fced9bf4d4d0822c77ba191b8dc98da43f38c61ab3b", "ja": "……{$P$}さん。\n授賞式、楽しみですね！", "zh": "……{$P$}先生。\n颁奖典礼，真让人期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
